  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (config_022) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.725). This experiment tests scvi_n200 RNA with resnet50 image encoder (less complex than imagenet_vit_l) and concat fusion (vs weighted), which could maintain high accuracy while reducing cost. It balances exploration of image encoder alternatives with exploitation of successful components (scvi_n200 and transformer), aiming to confirm or improve upon the current best with a lower GPU cost estimate (~4-5 hours)."
